order","to":"rhino-ele-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":8400,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"AHALDMJTR, DKHS MT WART BKQS."},{"seq":1368,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1659,"retries":0},{"seq":1369,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Truce with Tiger is in effect. My doctrine suggests making a friend. I should maintain pressure on the center/F2 while observing Tiger's disposition, as they are the current ally. I will hold F2 to secure the middle crossing."},{"seq":1370,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c493","house":"kite","letter":"L569","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":8400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":1371,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c494","house":"kite","letter":"L570","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":8400,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, DKHO TS IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":1372,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1725,"retries":0},{"seq":1373,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Watch 28/30. Tiger has proposed a truce. Given the late watch, I should accept the truce to consolidate gains or prepare for the final push. Orchid has units spread out. Rhinos are at F1. I will accept the truce and consolidate my forces."},{"seq":1374,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c495","house":"orchid","letter":"L571","kind":"letter","to":"tiger-camp","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","tiger-camp"],"depart":8100,"plain":"ACCEPT_TRUCE","cipher":null},{"seq":1375,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":2011,"retries":0},{"seq":1376,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Truce with Kite is active. Orchid is also allied. Rhino is hostile and strong at F1. I should consolidate forces and explo